"""📜 Lessons · Maths Grade 4 (MOE Primary 4, Abacus Orchard).
MA-5a: factors (factors & multiples with apple arrays: groups, then sort factor / not a factor), fracset (a fraction of a set:
share cupcakes onto plates, then fill), round (rounding to the nearest 10 and 100: the number-line hill, sort then fill).
MA-5b: longmul (the area model: Sumi's garden in 4 patches, fill; re-teach columns with carrying), longdiv (share in steps: hundreds,
tens, ones with regrouping and a remainder, fill; re-teach multiply back), decimal (tenths and hundredths of a snack, fill; re-teach cents, sort).
Format: LESSONS-PLAN.md §2."""
PACK = "m-g4"
F = lambda a, b: f"$\\frac{{{a}}}{{{b}}}$"
# cleanup (MA-5b): the shared "how to play" endings of the fill and sort prompts, written once
FILL_HOW = "Drag the right number into each gap, or tap it."
SORT_HOW = lambda bin: f"Drag each card into a {bin}, or tap a card and then a {bin}."
