      notes={"2, 4": "Don't forget 1 and 8! Every number has 1 and itself as factors: 1 × 8 = 8.", "1, 2, 4, 6, 8": "6 is not a factor of 8: 8 ÷ 6 = 1 r 2. The factor pairs are 1 × 8 and 2 × 4."},
