  hook=dict(text="Crumb the baker dragon is sharing wrapped sweets for Puffbun the bunny, Mog the kitten and Hoot the owl. But look at the 3 baskets: one is heaped high and one has only a few. That isn't fair! Crumb has 437 sweets: 4 big boxes of 100, 3 bags of 10 and 7 loose sweets. How can Crumb share them fairly?"),
